WEBVTT

01:25.752 --> 01:27.337
Are you sure I can trust you?

01:28.880 --> 01:30.381
I also cut my brother's hair for him.

01:30.465 --> 01:31.883
I'm the only one who can touch it.

01:35.094 --> 01:37.305
The sea should be here. Hello!

01:40.225 --> 01:42.143
He asked you to
cut his hair like that, right?

01:42.227 --> 01:43.061
No.

01:44.145 --> 01:45.647
I came up with that hairstyle.

01:46.231 --> 01:47.565
I don't want a mushroom haircut.

01:48.566 --> 01:49.567
It's too late.

01:50.151 --> 01:51.528
I have the scissors.

01:53.196 --> 01:54.948
Stay still if you want this to go well.

02:14.342 --> 02:15.218
It's all done.

03:14.402 --> 03:15.528
How do I look?

03:19.949 --> 03:20.950
You look pretty.

03:32.170 --> 03:34.339
I no longer need to listen to my mom

03:34.422 --> 03:35.715
now that I cut off my leash.

03:36.633 --> 03:38.134
So you wanted to escape from

03:38.718 --> 03:39.552
your mother?

03:41.304 --> 03:42.138
Yes.

03:42.931 --> 03:43.890
Now, I'm free.

03:46.184 --> 03:47.268
Congratulations.

03:49.812 --> 03:50.980
Don't congratulate me.

03:51.564 --> 03:52.440
I want a compliment.

03:58.780 --> 04:01.157
Good for you. I'm so proud of you.

04:04.494 --> 04:07.205
Now, let's go have fun wherever.
Whether it's to a mountain or a field.

04:08.331 --> 04:09.332
Like the Cheerful Dog?

04:09.415 --> 04:11.876
Yes, like the Cheerful Dog.

04:23.346 --> 04:27.976
CHAPTER 8
BEAUTY AND THE BEAST

04:28.559 --> 04:31.104
It is a flower

04:31.396 --> 04:34.232
Even if it blooms in the field
It is a flower

04:34.482 --> 04:37.735
It is a flower

04:38.486 --> 04:40.989
It is a flower

04:41.072 --> 04:43.032
They're all flowers

04:50.999 --> 04:54.794
What... What happened to your long hair?

04:54.877 --> 04:56.129
I cut it.

04:57.171 --> 04:59.173
- What do you think?
- Long hair suits you better.

05:00.258 --> 05:02.218
What do you mean?
She looks better with short hair.

05:02.302 --> 05:03.553
No.

05:03.636 --> 05:06.014
She looked 100 to 1,000 times better
when her long, black hair

05:06.097 --> 05:08.474
used to come down
all the way to her waist.

05:08.558 --> 05:09.684
Why did she cut it?

05:09.767 --> 05:12.103
- Why did you do that? Why?
- Sang-tae.

05:13.104 --> 05:15.940
Let me cut your hair today as well.
It's really long.

05:16.024 --> 05:17.608
You gave me a haircut on Wednesday.

05:17.692 --> 05:18.901
I only gave you a trim.

05:18.985 --> 05:20.987
Let's cut off a bit more today.
Now, eat up.

05:21.070 --> 05:23.573
Okay. You looked better with long hair.

05:23.656 --> 05:25.616
Why did you do that?
You shouldn't have cut it off.

05:27.660 --> 05:30.038
Why did you get such an ugly haircut?

05:30.872 --> 05:31.956
Why did you just kick me?

05:33.499 --> 05:35.293
- Me?
- Yes, that's right. You.

05:35.376 --> 05:37.420
You just kicked me three times.

05:37.503 --> 05:39.213
These darn quail eggs.

05:45.011 --> 05:46.012
Here.

05:55.480 --> 05:56.481
I want a rolled omelet.

06:08.993 --> 06:09.869
Here.

06:18.711 --> 06:21.214
- Here.
- You should do it yourself.

06:21.798 --> 06:23.466
You're not a baby.

06:24.175 --> 06:27.220
Your brother is so slow-witted.

06:28.846 --> 06:30.223
You mean he's too honest.

06:31.808 --> 06:33.434
Are you taking your brother's side?

06:34.268 --> 06:35.895
Of course. We're brothers.

06:38.439 --> 06:39.273
Hey.

06:42.193 --> 06:44.112
Come home as soon as you finish work.

06:44.445 --> 06:45.738
Come and spend time with me.

07:33.619 --> 07:35.830
From now on,
you're in charge of cutting my hair.

07:35.913 --> 07:36.747
Okay?

07:37.874 --> 07:39.125
Why not just go to a hair salon?

07:41.043 --> 07:42.879
I'm just like your brother.

07:42.962 --> 07:44.630
I don't like it
when other people touch me.

07:45.590 --> 07:47.800
But you're an exception.
Only you can touch me.

07:55.683 --> 07:57.059
Do I really look pretty?

08:03.399 --> 08:04.317
Yes.

08:05.109 --> 08:06.027
You look pretty.

08:15.036 --> 08:16.037
I agree.

08:17.038 --> 08:18.581
I also think I'm really pretty.

08:21.501 --> 08:22.710
What was that laugh for?

08:24.504 --> 08:26.464
Don't fight with Sang-tae.
Make sure you get along.

08:27.882 --> 08:28.841
I'll see you.

08:34.472 --> 08:36.349
Come home quickly.
If you're late, I'll kill you.

09:15.471 --> 09:17.265
- Hello.
- Hello.

09:21.936 --> 09:25.022
KO MUN-YEONG'S FAIRY TALE CLASS
PUT ON PAUSE TEMPORARILY

09:34.657 --> 09:35.866
Gosh, you scared me.

09:36.951 --> 09:38.452
Do I look that bad?

09:41.581 --> 09:42.665
I look like a zombie.

09:43.916 --> 09:45.209
Did something happen at night?

09:46.419 --> 09:47.378
Do you have a concealer?

09:48.045 --> 09:49.255
- What's that?
- Maybe a cushion?

09:49.338 --> 09:51.465
- The cushions are in the lounge.
- No, a cushion compact.

09:53.634 --> 09:54.468
Forget it.

09:56.804 --> 09:59.056
Did something happen with a patient?
Who was it?

09:59.515 --> 10:00.683
Mr. Ko Dae-hwan.

10:01.267 --> 10:02.226
Why? What happened?

10:04.103 --> 10:06.814
He had a seizure last night again.
It was a complete nightmare.

10:07.481 --> 10:10.067
He came out to the hallway
with his eyes rolling upwards.

10:10.151 --> 10:12.361
Then he started foaming at the mouth
and had spasms.

10:14.739 --> 10:16.490
I didn't get to sleep a wink.

10:17.825 --> 10:21.287
Gosh, why does this happen
every time I'm on night duty?

10:21.495 --> 10:22.705
Why?

10:31.380 --> 10:32.256
My goodness.

10:35.801 --> 10:37.053
Do you think he'll be okay?

10:37.720 --> 10:39.930
I'm worried he might have
another brain tumor.

10:40.139 --> 10:41.974
He kept talking gibberish all night.

10:42.141 --> 10:43.559
Don't worry too much.

10:44.852 --> 10:46.562
I bet you didn't get any sleep last night.

10:46.729 --> 10:48.898
I was actually thinking about
skipping meditation class

10:48.981 --> 10:50.650
and get some good sleep instead.

10:50.733 --> 10:52.234
You should do that. Here.

11:00.826 --> 11:01.661
Get some sleep.

11:12.713 --> 11:13.923
Mr. Moon.

11:15.508 --> 11:16.801
Mr. Ko has drooled too much.

11:17.802 --> 11:18.928
Can you help him get changed?

11:19.804 --> 11:20.721
Sure.

11:26.644 --> 11:28.646
That woman...

11:31.357 --> 11:32.650
sang

11:33.442 --> 11:34.902
a song.

11:35.861 --> 11:37.947
What song?

11:38.531 --> 11:39.698
"Oh My Darling, Clementine."

11:41.659 --> 11:42.910
I'm sure

11:44.787 --> 11:45.955
she's dead.

11:51.919 --> 11:53.421
But that woman

11:55.881 --> 11:57.716
is here.

12:00.261 --> 12:01.512
Who are you

12:02.805 --> 12:03.639
talking about?

12:07.893 --> 12:09.937
She's dead.

12:12.440 --> 12:13.649
But she's here.

12:21.365 --> 12:24.368
WHAT IS THE TRUTH BEHIND WRITER
KO MUN-YEONG'S DISAPPEARANCE?

12:24.452 --> 12:26.287
KO MUN-YEONG IS LOOKING AFTER
HER SICK FATHER

12:26.370 --> 12:27.621
IS SHE PLANNING TO RETIRE?

12:31.083 --> 12:33.002
She's pretending to be a kind daughter.

12:33.085 --> 12:34.837
I bet she doesn't even care.

12:34.920 --> 12:37.840
She needs to become a better person first.

12:37.923 --> 12:40.342
A fairy tale writer who cusses
doesn't deserve to write.

12:40.426 --> 12:42.636
I really regret having read her books.

12:43.137 --> 12:46.724
I want to gather these insects
and spray pesticide on them.

12:47.766 --> 12:49.101
Darn it.

12:49.185 --> 12:51.729
I used to have tons of fans.
Where in the world are they?

13:00.696 --> 13:03.115
Actually, my fan is right here.

13:03.199 --> 13:06.660
Don't forget to ventilate the room
after you spray pesticide.

13:06.744 --> 13:10.789
But if you want to kill insects properly,
electric fly swatters are the best.

13:11.957 --> 13:14.585
Sang-tae, why do you like my fairy tales?

13:16.670 --> 13:18.339
Because you wrote them.

13:20.966 --> 13:23.636
So you like me, not my fairy tales.

13:24.428 --> 13:26.096
- Why do you like me?
- Because you're pretty.

13:28.682 --> 13:30.476
What do you like about me?

13:32.144 --> 13:34.605
Your hair. Your long hair.

13:35.064 --> 13:37.316
Your long, black hair
that came all the way to your waist.

13:37.399 --> 13:39.235
It was so pretty. Gosh.

13:39.777 --> 13:42.071
- You cut it off. You shouldn't have.
- End of meeting.

13:44.865 --> 13:46.367
We never started a meeting.

13:46.450 --> 13:48.661
How can you end a meeting
when we never even started one?

13:48.744 --> 13:50.204
You give me a headache.

13:50.287 --> 13:52.122
- Let's have a meeting later.
- "Later?"

13:52.414 --> 13:53.666
Later... Later.

13:54.041 --> 13:56.085
You mean sometime before you die?

13:56.460 --> 13:59.129
No, I need to get a camping car.

13:59.213 --> 14:01.507
I need to receive a camping car.

14:06.720 --> 14:08.389
Did you get the information I asked for?

14:11.809 --> 14:15.437
I know you told me
this is all part of work,

14:16.021 --> 14:18.315
but I felt so uneasy
about doing a background search.

14:18.399 --> 14:19.525
Why?

14:20.150 --> 14:22.152
You're good at doing that.

14:22.403 --> 14:26.574
If you hadn't done a background search
on that caregiver for Mun-yeong--

14:26.657 --> 14:28.576
Her name is Nam Ju-ri.
She's currently single.

14:29.076 --> 14:31.370
She met Moon Gang-tae
when they worked together

14:31.453 --> 14:32.913
at the same hospital a year ago.

14:34.456 --> 14:35.833
They haven't known each other long.

14:35.916 --> 14:38.252
Her father died due to an illness
when she was little.

14:38.335 --> 14:39.795
Oh, dear.

14:39.879 --> 14:42.715
And her mother used to cook
for construction workers.

14:42.798 --> 14:44.675
My goodness, she had a tough life.

14:45.259 --> 14:48.095
Right now, she's working as a cook
at OK Psychiatric Hospital.

14:48.178 --> 14:50.306
And the daughter and mother
are living together

14:50.389 --> 14:52.391
at a two-story house
with a mortgage to pay off.

14:52.474 --> 14:54.435
The Moon brothers live
in the rooftop house.

14:54.518 --> 14:57.980
And their friend who runs a pizza place
lives in the basement.

14:58.397 --> 15:01.066
And apparently, the owner of the house
gives them meals for free.

15:02.484 --> 15:04.028
They're practically lodgers.

15:04.820 --> 15:05.654
Mr. Lee.

15:06.655 --> 15:07.740
Do you like that nurse?

15:09.491 --> 15:13.662
Hey, why are you so quick-witted
when it comes to stuff like this?

15:13.746 --> 15:15.039
Why can't you be like this with work?

15:21.211 --> 15:22.212
Hey.

15:23.339 --> 15:24.757
Be honest with me.

15:25.466 --> 15:26.592
About what?

15:27.301 --> 15:30.137
Between me and that caregiver...

15:30.763 --> 15:32.014
Who do you think is better?

15:32.097 --> 15:33.265
For a romantic relationship?

15:33.349 --> 15:36.185
I'm taller and bigger than him.

15:36.268 --> 15:39.063
And think about
my social position and maturity.

15:39.563 --> 15:41.315
Aren't I much better than him?

15:42.733 --> 15:45.152
But you lack the most important trait.

15:47.529 --> 15:48.364
What's that?

15:50.574 --> 15:52.826
This. Your face.

15:52.910 --> 15:56.246
My gosh. You little!

16:19.395 --> 16:20.396
How do I look?

16:21.689 --> 16:22.690
You look pretty.

16:29.363 --> 16:31.949
I must be crazy.

17:16.535 --> 17:19.997
Hey, can I talk to Ms. Park Ok-ran?

17:21.457 --> 17:22.624
Yes, right now.

17:25.836 --> 17:26.795
Come in.

17:27.421 --> 17:28.505
DIRECTOR'S OFFICE

17:30.132 --> 17:31.258
My goodness.

17:32.259 --> 17:34.428
Hello, Ms. Park.

17:35.179 --> 17:37.181
You can sit over here.

17:41.643 --> 17:42.644
Stay.

17:42.728 --> 17:43.562
Just stay.

17:45.564 --> 17:48.901
My goodness, you look great these days.

17:48.984 --> 17:50.903
I guess the medicine is working.

17:52.821 --> 17:54.323
Why did you want to see me?

17:54.740 --> 17:58.660
I wanted to ask you something.

17:59.661 --> 18:03.624
By any chance,
did you happen to see Mr. Ko Dae-hwan

18:04.500 --> 18:05.626
in the hallway last night

18:06.752 --> 18:08.420
at around midnight?

18:10.506 --> 18:11.465
I did

18:12.341 --> 18:14.551
go to the bathroom at that hour.

18:15.969 --> 18:16.804
But I didn't see him.

18:22.518 --> 18:26.230
By any chance, did you sing a song
when you went to the bathroom?

18:26.939 --> 18:28.023
A song?

18:29.608 --> 18:30.442
What song?

18:32.027 --> 18:35.781
Ever since he regained consciousness
he keeps saying the same thing.

18:37.032 --> 18:38.575
What was it... You know...

18:38.659 --> 18:39.493
Right!

18:41.370 --> 18:42.704
"Oh My Darling, Clementine."

18:43.956 --> 18:46.750
He keeps saying that he heard that song.

18:48.752 --> 18:55.634
In a cavern, in a canyon,

18:55.884 --> 18:58.720
Excavating for a mine

18:59.263 --> 19:02.266
...sang a song.

19:03.809 --> 19:05.435
"Oh My Darling, Clementine."

19:06.395 --> 19:09.231
Lived a miner

19:09.815 --> 19:13.318
forty-niner,

19:14.945 --> 19:17.573
- I'm not a ghost.
- "A ghost"?

19:17.656 --> 19:20.200
Yoo Seon-hae,
that woman who used to be a shaman,

19:20.576 --> 19:21.743
keeps talking nonsense.

19:22.995 --> 19:25.581
She keeps saying a ghost shows up at night

19:26.206 --> 19:27.875
and sings at the end of the hallway.

19:33.463 --> 19:34.381
But

19:35.299 --> 19:37.050
I'm not a ghost.

19:38.260 --> 19:41.054
Of course you're not a ghost.

19:42.973 --> 19:44.099
So you didn't sing that song?

19:46.518 --> 19:47.352
No, I didn't.

19:49.229 --> 19:50.522
Okay then.

20:04.995 --> 20:06.496
Why are you smiling?

20:07.581 --> 20:08.415
It's just that

20:09.791 --> 20:11.418
no one's really paid attention to me

20:12.502 --> 20:14.880
even though I've been here
for a few months.

20:16.548 --> 20:18.133
But now, people are paying attention.

20:21.929 --> 20:22.763
How interesting.

20:29.102 --> 20:30.687
OK PSYCHIATRIC HOSPITAL

20:36.026 --> 20:42.199
You are lost and gone forever,

20:42.407 --> 20:48.080
Dreadful sorry Clementine

20:48.997 --> 20:50.082
It's that song.

20:51.458 --> 20:53.460
Why do you think she lied?

20:56.922 --> 20:57.923
I don't know.

20:59.841 --> 21:00.676
But

21:01.802 --> 21:03.679
why are you asking me?

21:04.263 --> 21:07.766
Ms. Ko Mun-yeong
is Mr. Ko Dae-hwan's only guardian.

21:08.475 --> 21:11.019
And right now, you're pretty much

21:11.603 --> 21:13.230
Ms. Ko Mun-yeong's guardian.

21:14.773 --> 21:16.275
So it's kind of your business as well.

21:17.693 --> 21:19.069
I don't think it is.

21:24.199 --> 21:25.200
Chew on this.

21:26.743 --> 21:29.871
Chewing on something
helps you prevent dementia.

21:32.457 --> 21:35.210
It seems like something strange
is happening at our hospital.

21:36.503 --> 21:39.256
Let's keep this between you and me
for the time being.

21:40.799 --> 21:43.427
And during that time,
I'd like you to keep a close eye

21:44.594 --> 21:46.596
on Ms. Park Ok-ran.

21:49.891 --> 21:52.644
You're teaming up with the most
powerful man in this hospital.

21:56.690 --> 21:58.400
Are you just going to chew and ignore me?

22:05.073 --> 22:06.116
What do you want?

22:11.830 --> 22:13.999
KO MUN-YEONG'S FAIRY TALE CLASS
PUT ON PAUSE TEMPORARILY

22:29.264 --> 22:31.641
- Where are you going?
- The Chinese restaurant and pizza place.

22:32.142 --> 22:33.351
You're going to eat that much?

22:33.435 --> 22:35.812
I'm having Chinese with Gang-tae,
and I work at the pizzeria.

22:36.396 --> 22:39.024
"Gang-tae"? I want to go, too.

22:41.902 --> 22:44.738
HARIMGAK

22:44.821 --> 22:45.864
Here's your jjamppong.

22:45.947 --> 22:47.699
This is that jjamppong.

22:48.450 --> 22:51.286
It has mussels and chili pepper inside.

22:51.369 --> 22:53.121
The broth tastes amazing.

22:58.251 --> 23:00.921
Why would you come to a shabby place
like this to eat jjamppong?

23:01.004 --> 23:02.672
Our mom used to bring us here often

23:03.256 --> 23:04.883
because I loved the jjamppong here.

23:04.966 --> 23:06.885
"I want to have it every day, Mom.

23:06.968 --> 23:09.096
I want to eat it every day."

23:11.348 --> 23:12.349
No wonder.

23:13.266 --> 23:15.477
It seemed like a famous restaurant
with a long history.

23:18.063 --> 23:18.897
Eat up.

23:36.123 --> 23:38.083
Here. Eat up.

23:39.459 --> 23:40.460
What about you, Mom?

23:40.669 --> 23:41.878
I'm not hungry.

23:53.056 --> 23:54.432
Is it good?

23:56.434 --> 23:57.853
- Yes.
- Really?

24:00.730 --> 24:02.274
It's spicy.

24:06.987 --> 24:08.947
Holy shit! It's so damn spicy!

24:14.077 --> 24:15.412
It's capsaicin.

24:15.495 --> 24:17.164
Capsaicin can be very addictive.

24:17.247 --> 24:20.125
It releases endorphins when you eat it
and helps you get rid of your stress.

24:20.667 --> 24:23.128
But it hurts when you poop.
It hurts when you poop the next day.

24:23.211 --> 24:24.796
Your butthole hurts so much.

24:24.880 --> 24:27.048
It's... It's so spicy.

24:40.687 --> 24:42.314
- So cold!
- Thank you.

24:42.606 --> 24:44.024
- Thank you.
- I'll bring this back.

24:44.107 --> 24:45.108
- Here.
- I love it.

24:46.026 --> 24:47.569
Sang-tae, you're getting wet.

24:49.321 --> 24:51.239
It's... It's raining. Wasn't it delicious?

24:53.116 --> 24:54.492
It's sunny, but it's raining.

24:54.576 --> 24:55.702
It's raining.

24:55.785 --> 24:57.287
- It's pouring. I love it.
- Slow down.

24:58.246 --> 25:01.041
Capsaicin is really addictive.
Don't you think so?

25:01.124 --> 25:02.375
We had a big meal.

25:02.459 --> 25:03.543
- We did, didn't we?
- Yes.

25:03.627 --> 25:05.253
I wonder why it's raining.

25:05.337 --> 25:07.297
- Slow down.
- It's pouring.

25:07.380 --> 25:09.341
- Let's slow down.
- Gosh, we had a really big meal.

25:09.424 --> 25:11.384
It's pouring over here as well.

25:11.468 --> 25:12.552
Let me join.

25:14.846 --> 25:16.056
Capsaicin is really addictive.

25:16.139 --> 25:18.266
Ms. Ko finished everything
because it was so yummy.

25:18.808 --> 25:20.435
It will hurt when you poop.

25:20.518 --> 25:22.812
Has it ever happened before?
It hurts a lot.

25:44.376 --> 25:45.585
Let's have coffee together.

25:45.794 --> 25:47.671
Go by yourself.
My lunch break is almost over.

25:47.754 --> 25:49.172
It will only take ten minutes.

26:06.147 --> 26:07.649
Two iced Americano coffee, please.

26:07.732 --> 26:08.566
Okay.

26:36.553 --> 26:37.387
I want it.

26:57.365 --> 26:58.408
Excuse me.

26:59.326 --> 27:00.785
Are you Ms. Ko Mun-yeong?

27:04.289 --> 27:05.582
My goodness, it's you.

27:06.541 --> 27:08.668
I can't believe I'm meeting you here.
This is amazing.

27:09.252 --> 27:11.046
- Do you know me?
- Of course.

27:11.838 --> 27:13.465
I've been your fan for a long time.

27:14.466 --> 27:15.550
Just a second.

27:18.553 --> 27:20.013
Here. This is my business card.

27:32.901 --> 27:36.696
- By any chance, is he your boyfriend?
- No, he's just someone I know.

27:39.783 --> 27:40.617
That's good to hear.

27:40.700 --> 27:41.951
Have a seat.

27:43.203 --> 27:45.372
Well then,
I guess I'll join you for a moment.

27:51.503 --> 27:55.507
Last summer, our company was
in charge of planning

27:56.257 --> 27:58.176
your art book event.

27:58.760 --> 27:59.928
But I bet you don't remember.

28:01.221 --> 28:04.057
Back then, I saw you from a distance.

28:04.182 --> 28:06.101
I can't believe I'm seeing you here.

28:06.184 --> 28:07.519
That's what you call destiny.

28:08.144 --> 28:09.062
"Destiny"?

28:09.145 --> 28:11.064
I'm hoping that destiny

28:12.315 --> 28:14.567
will allow us to keep in touch.

28:16.611 --> 28:18.071
If you ever have time,

28:18.154 --> 28:19.906
we should meet up for a meal.

28:20.490 --> 28:21.783
Sure.

28:22.867 --> 28:26.621
Then here. Can you write down
your phone number for me?

28:38.007 --> 28:41.719
Dear Daniel, I hope you buy me beef.

28:41.970 --> 28:44.764
Mun-yeong will be waiting for your call.

28:47.892 --> 28:48.893
Excuse me.

28:49.227 --> 28:50.603
Sir.

28:52.063 --> 28:54.023
- Yes?
- I'm sorry.

28:54.649 --> 28:56.526
But can you take a photo of us together?

28:57.110 --> 28:58.778
Oh, sure.

28:58.945 --> 29:00.196
Click on the camera icon.

29:06.369 --> 29:07.620
One, two...

29:11.750 --> 29:14.085
About your hand on her waist...

29:14.169 --> 29:15.336
You want his hand on my waist?

29:18.214 --> 29:19.466
Here. Take the photo.

29:31.728 --> 29:33.104
You're very nice to your fans.

29:33.480 --> 29:36.900
According to Mr. Lee, I sell one more book
every time I smile at a fan.

29:36.983 --> 29:38.860
You should be focusing on writing,
not marketing.

29:40.069 --> 29:41.821
And why would you give him your number

29:41.905 --> 29:43.615
when you don't even know him that well?

29:44.199 --> 29:46.117
I couldn't help it. I like handsome stuff.

29:46.201 --> 29:47.327
"Handsome"?

29:49.120 --> 29:49.996
What's wrong?

29:51.414 --> 29:53.374
Go home. I need to get going now.

30:04.260 --> 30:05.345
Are you

30:07.138 --> 30:08.181
jealous?

30:08.848 --> 30:10.141
Don't be ridiculous.

30:10.517 --> 30:11.851
I'm late, thanks to you.

30:14.437 --> 30:16.439
Handsome, my ass!

30:17.315 --> 30:18.858
He's such a cheeseball.

30:33.373 --> 30:34.582
How handsome.

30:39.546 --> 30:40.672
Gosh, I'm hungry.

30:46.803 --> 30:48.054
- What?
- What is it?

30:48.137 --> 30:49.389
Do you know that man?

30:59.440 --> 31:00.608
I don't want that.

31:00.692 --> 31:04.112
No, please. No way.

31:05.738 --> 31:08.741
You don't want that? So what?
It's my house.

31:08.825 --> 31:10.994
I've been paying
half of the mortgage payments.

31:11.744 --> 31:13.705
Don't you feel bad
for the situation he's in?

31:13.788 --> 31:15.373
He doesn't know anyone in Seongjin City,

31:15.456 --> 31:17.584
and he's broke
because his company went belly up.

31:24.382 --> 31:26.259
Okay, but why do you have to help him?

31:26.342 --> 31:27.760
Why do you care?

31:27.844 --> 31:28.803
How can I not care?

31:28.887 --> 31:31.306
He's the CEO of the publishing company
Sang-tae is signed with.

31:31.389 --> 31:33.016
But we don't even have an empty room...

31:35.602 --> 31:36.603
Mom.

31:38.062 --> 31:40.356
Don't tell me you'll let him
move into the room on the roof.

31:44.027 --> 31:45.069
Mom?

31:45.695 --> 31:47.071
- Just split it, then.
- Split what?

31:47.155 --> 31:50.074
You and Jae-su should
split your rooms in half.

31:51.284 --> 31:53.077
Does she think my room is a chicken?

31:53.161 --> 31:54.579
It's not like ordering
half and half chicken!

31:54.662 --> 31:58.124
I have to share the room with the guy
from the publishing company?

31:58.207 --> 32:00.001
I get that she wants more rent,

32:00.084 --> 32:02.754
but she's abusing her power
as the landlady. Don't you agree?

32:06.090 --> 32:08.718
Jeez, I heard he's moving in today.
I'm so upset.

32:09.302 --> 32:12.889
Everyone around that woman,
Ko Mun-yeong, is such a pain in the butt!

32:14.933 --> 32:16.976
Stop scratching. It'll bleed.

32:18.811 --> 32:20.021
Sang-tae!

32:22.941 --> 32:24.359
Are you mad at me?

32:24.567 --> 32:26.277
I kept calling you,
but you didn't pick up.

32:26.361 --> 32:29.072
I thought you were avoiding me
because you feel bad about slapping me--

32:32.200 --> 32:34.535
Why does it have to be my place?

32:35.536 --> 32:36.537
Because of you, I guess?

32:41.417 --> 32:42.835
There's someone I like.

32:42.919 --> 32:45.046
Yes, I know.

32:46.673 --> 32:48.633
The unrequited love
you want to give up on.

32:50.885 --> 32:52.053
But you know, Ju-ri...

32:54.013 --> 32:55.556
Don't turn into a bitch.

32:56.933 --> 32:58.810
Why can't it be me?

33:00.520 --> 33:02.188
Why that bitch?

33:02.814 --> 33:04.023
And I can

33:05.900 --> 33:08.236
be a bitch too.

33:09.862 --> 33:11.906
You're kind and sweet.

33:11.990 --> 33:14.909
You should meet a guy
who will love you for who you are.

33:16.995 --> 33:19.163
I'm not kind.

33:20.039 --> 33:20.915
Well...

33:21.624 --> 33:23.584
Most people who say that they're not kind

33:24.252 --> 33:25.211
tend to be kind.

33:27.964 --> 33:30.425
Gosh, whatever.

33:36.431 --> 33:38.641
Both the nice girl and the bitch

33:38.766 --> 33:41.185
are head over heels for the same guy.

33:48.401 --> 33:50.445
Jeez, what? What's your problem?

33:50.528 --> 33:52.238
You want me gone or what?

33:53.072 --> 33:54.907
I heard you told her that
a copy of her book

33:55.241 --> 33:57.243
will sell every time
she smiles at her fans.

33:58.119 --> 33:59.704
An author only needs to write well.

33:59.787 --> 34:01.205
She's not a celebrity.

34:01.289 --> 34:03.958
Why must she be extra friendly
when it's not necessary?

34:04.292 --> 34:06.711
Because of your third-rate sales tactics,

34:06.794 --> 34:10.298
she's learned to call
just about anyone handsome

34:10.757 --> 34:12.216
and make finger hearts all the time.

34:12.550 --> 34:14.427
She lets a stranger
put his arm around her waist

34:14.510 --> 34:16.512
and even goes out to eat
with a guy she doesn't know.

34:17.847 --> 34:20.183
You forced her to smile so often

34:20.391 --> 34:22.351
that she only raises
the corners of her mouth

34:23.102 --> 34:24.687
and looks like the Joker when she smiles.

34:25.271 --> 34:27.023
What the heck are you talking about now?

34:27.106 --> 34:29.108
Do your job better!

34:31.027 --> 34:32.028
Seriously.

34:37.742 --> 34:40.870
What did I do so wrong?

35:04.143 --> 35:05.019
A-reum.

35:06.562 --> 35:07.563
A-reum?

35:09.524 --> 35:11.484
Gosh, my feet fell asleep.

35:13.069 --> 35:15.071
I'm so sorry.

35:15.154 --> 35:17.907
That old man, Mr. Kan, kept pestering me
to play table tennis with him,

35:17.990 --> 35:19.200
so I had to shake him off.

35:19.283 --> 35:20.576
You must be exhausted.

35:23.204 --> 35:26.124
How much longer do we have to meet up
in secret like this?

35:28.584 --> 35:31.379
You know that patients are not allowed
to date one another.

35:32.046 --> 35:35.383
There are eyes everywhere.
This linen room is the only safe place.

35:36.175 --> 35:37.260
Those jerks.

35:39.637 --> 35:41.139
Let's just try to make the most of it.

35:41.556 --> 35:44.100
Why don't we just enjoy the thrill
until we're discharged?

35:45.726 --> 35:49.021
I feel as though
we're in some tragic love story.

35:54.902 --> 35:55.903
A-reum.

35:57.155 --> 35:58.906
If you don't mind,

35:58.990 --> 36:01.242
I want to kiss...

36:03.119 --> 36:04.287
May I kiss you?

36:05.079 --> 36:06.080
Oh, gosh.

36:21.596 --> 36:25.224
Damn it. I'm sleepy.
Why do I have to change the sheets now?

36:25.725 --> 36:27.226
I'm so annoyed.

36:30.771 --> 36:33.941
She always works me like a dog
when I'm working overtime.

36:34.150 --> 36:35.526
Park Haeng-ja, that old witch.

36:37.862 --> 36:39.614
I'll do it later. Just get some rest.

36:39.864 --> 36:40.823
Really?

36:41.407 --> 36:43.201
Then can I nap here for just an hour?

36:43.659 --> 36:45.453
But I can't help you
if Ms. Park finds out.

36:45.536 --> 36:46.454
That's fine.

36:47.455 --> 36:49.498
Oh, boy. I'm exhausted.

37:18.486 --> 37:20.029
Be careful.

37:20.404 --> 37:21.405
What the...

37:32.792 --> 37:36.671
Just this one time. Please pretend you
didn't see anything just this once.

37:37.463 --> 37:40.049
Gang-tae. Please, big brother.

37:41.676 --> 37:43.177
From what I know, I'm younger than you.

37:45.513 --> 37:48.599
Gang-tae, let us love. Please?

37:48.683 --> 37:49.517
Get up.

37:50.184 --> 37:53.271
You see, love is not a sin.

37:53.354 --> 37:54.897
Patients are human too.

37:55.940 --> 37:57.275
Right, it's not a sin.

37:58.067 --> 37:59.151
But, it's against the rules.

38:02.321 --> 38:03.489
I can't believe this.

38:06.242 --> 38:07.076
Gosh, A-reum.

38:10.288 --> 38:11.580
One of you

38:12.331 --> 38:13.499
will probably be transferred.

38:18.004 --> 38:18.921
Brother, please.

38:19.213 --> 38:20.965
Do not tell your higher-ups.

38:22.049 --> 38:23.175
Please, I beg you.

38:27.221 --> 38:29.682
You should focus on your treatment

38:30.057 --> 38:31.684
so that you can be discharged soon.

38:32.852 --> 38:33.936
Once you leave here,

38:35.146 --> 38:36.647
no one will try to break you two apart.

38:41.569 --> 38:43.696
Damn it.

38:52.955 --> 38:54.040
I'm home!

38:54.123 --> 38:55.333
Hi, Sang-tae.

38:59.128 --> 39:00.463
Gosh, I don't want to do this.

39:04.342 --> 39:05.468
I'm bored.

39:17.104 --> 39:18.356
Sang-tae.

39:18.439 --> 39:21.484
Can't you knock? It's rude
to just barge in without knocking.

39:21.567 --> 39:23.486
Hang out with me. Can you play poker?

39:24.153 --> 39:26.113
- Oh, Mang-tae.
- No, poker.

39:26.197 --> 39:27.448
Mang-tae is mine.

39:27.531 --> 39:29.575
It's mine now. Gang-tae gave it to me.

39:29.658 --> 39:30.993
No.

39:31.077 --> 39:31.911
Mang-tae...

39:31.994 --> 39:34.163
Gang-tae made it in May of 2007
and gave it to me.

39:34.246 --> 39:37.124
He said Mang-tae would eat up
all my nightmares, so I--

39:37.208 --> 39:39.794
I adopted Mang-tae in June of 2020,
so it's mine now.

39:39.877 --> 39:43.506
No, that's not true.
I never gave him up for adoption, so how?

39:43.589 --> 39:45.633
- Mang-tae is mine.
- No, it's mine.

39:45.716 --> 39:46.592
No, Mang-tae is mine.

39:46.675 --> 39:48.344
- No, Gang-tae gave it to me.
- Give it back.

39:48.427 --> 39:49.637
- No, it's mine.
- No, it's mine.

39:49.720 --> 39:50.971
- It's Sang-tae's.
- No, it's mine!

39:51.055 --> 39:52.348
- No, it's mine!
- Give it back!

39:52.431 --> 39:54.308
- It's mine.
- Please, give it back.

39:54.392 --> 39:55.559
Mang-tae belongs to Sang-tae.

39:55.643 --> 39:57.353
- No, it's mine.
- Mang-tae is mine!

39:57.436 --> 39:58.979
- No! It's mine. Give it back!
- It's mine!

39:59.063 --> 40:00.356
- Mang-tae is mine!
- It's mine!

40:00.439 --> 40:01.524
It's mine...

40:54.368 --> 40:55.494
Sang-tae?

40:56.787 --> 40:59.623
- Mang-tae is mine!
- No, Mang-tae is mine!

40:59.707 --> 41:01.167
- I said, it's mine!
- Mang-tae is mine!

41:01.250 --> 41:02.460
- It's mine.
- It's mine!

41:02.543 --> 41:04.336
- Mang-tae is mine.
- I told you that it's mine!

41:04.420 --> 41:05.921
- No! It's mine!
- It's mine!

41:06.005 --> 41:07.131
- It's mine.
- Mang-tae is mine!

41:07.214 --> 41:09.091
- No, it's mine!
- No, it's not!

41:13.846 --> 41:16.849
- Who does Mang-tae belong to?
- Who does Mang-tae belong to?

41:16.932 --> 41:18.809
It's mine, right? You gave it to me.

41:18.893 --> 41:19.894
We're three brothers.

41:19.977 --> 41:21.645
Mang-tae, Gang-tae, and Sang-tae, right?

41:22.521 --> 41:23.939
- Both of you.
- It's mine!

41:24.023 --> 41:25.733
No, I told you that
Mang-tae is mine. Mine!

41:25.816 --> 41:28.152
- No, it's mine!
- Mang-tae is mine.

41:28.235 --> 41:29.904
- It's mine.
- Mang-tae is mine!

41:29.987 --> 41:31.113
- Mang-tae is mine!
- Be quiet!

41:48.130 --> 41:49.131
Both of you, give it back.

41:54.512 --> 41:55.596
One.

41:56.305 --> 41:57.181
Two.

41:59.767 --> 42:00.935
Three.

42:01.018 --> 42:02.311
Hey!

42:02.603 --> 42:04.563
Go away! I hate you!

42:04.647 --> 42:05.981
- I hate you.
- Hey!

42:06.857 --> 42:09.109
I hate Ms. Ko Mun-yeong.

42:09.693 --> 42:13.405
Ms. Ko Mun-yeong is vicious.
She's a real fighter.

42:14.406 --> 42:15.282
Ko Mun-yeong...

42:15.366 --> 42:16.325
You too. Give it back.

42:16.408 --> 42:19.411
You gave it to me! You can't take it back!

42:19.495 --> 42:22.289
I told you not to fight with Sang-tae.
Anyway, give it to me.

42:25.292 --> 42:26.418
Give it back, now.

42:28.754 --> 42:29.630
There!

42:47.022 --> 42:48.649
You jerk! You petty asshole!

42:48.732 --> 42:49.984
You petty bastard!

42:50.067 --> 42:51.443
I can't believe that petty bastard!

42:57.992 --> 43:00.160
Sang-tae, come out.

43:01.078 --> 43:02.037
You should get changed.

43:06.667 --> 43:08.586
If you don't want to come out,
just open the door.

43:19.471 --> 43:20.556
You know that Mang-tae

43:22.933 --> 43:24.435
can't catch the butterflies anyway.

43:25.811 --> 43:27.980
Mang-tae can't catch the butterflies.

43:29.398 --> 43:30.524
What did you say?

43:31.400 --> 43:32.484
I can't really hear you.

43:36.655 --> 43:38.616
He's of no use
if he can't catch the butterflies.

43:39.950 --> 43:40.868
Exactly.

43:41.827 --> 43:44.121
You shoved it into the drawer
and forgot about it,

43:44.997 --> 43:46.290
so I gave it to Ms. Ko.

43:51.920 --> 43:53.797
I'm sorry I didn't ask
for your permission first.

43:54.465 --> 43:56.925
But when you don't need something,

43:57.885 --> 43:59.970
it's nice to offer it
to someone who needs it.

44:01.513 --> 44:02.348
"Offer"?

44:02.431 --> 44:04.600
Yes, that's right.

44:05.351 --> 44:06.352
But...

44:07.394 --> 44:10.022
if I give all my stuff
to people who need them,

44:10.773 --> 44:11.607
what about me?

44:13.901 --> 44:15.527
What will I have left?

44:23.577 --> 44:24.495
You will

44:25.704 --> 44:26.830
always have me.

44:28.165 --> 44:30.334
Forget Mang-tae. You have Gang-tae.

44:31.960 --> 44:33.921
Ms. Ko is alone, so she needs Mang-tae.

44:34.004 --> 44:36.548
Then will you let her have Mang-tae?

44:36.632 --> 44:39.385
Yes, she can have him.
She can have Mang-tae, not Gang-tae.

44:43.389 --> 44:45.015
She can have Mang-tae, not Gang-tae.

44:48.727 --> 44:49.561
Yes.

44:51.563 --> 44:53.732
She can have Mang-tae, not Gang-tae.

44:53.816 --> 44:54.942
Yes, she can take him.

45:10.541 --> 45:11.375
Hey.

45:14.420 --> 45:16.046
I can't sleep because I'm fuming mad.

45:16.130 --> 45:17.965
What did I do wrong?

45:18.549 --> 45:20.134
Sang-tae said you could have him.

45:21.844 --> 45:22.761
Mang-tae.

45:23.929 --> 45:25.180
Mang-tae is all yours now.

45:28.767 --> 45:30.811
Whatever. It was mine to begin with.

45:31.395 --> 45:33.355
Try to stay calm
even when Sang-tae gets worked up.

45:33.439 --> 45:35.732
- Don't give me orders.
- It's not an order.

45:39.278 --> 45:40.362
I'm asking you for a favor.

45:48.162 --> 45:49.913
But how can I suppress my anger
and stay calm?

45:53.709 --> 45:55.419
Tell me. You're an expert at it.

45:57.588 --> 45:59.715
I saw you do it
when I cut your hand with a knife.

46:01.008 --> 46:04.303
Even when that man grabbed your brother
by the hair at the bookstore

46:05.179 --> 46:08.140
and when your brother
beat the crap out of you on the floor.

46:09.141 --> 46:11.351
You just kept it all inside
and let him beat you up.

46:14.271 --> 46:15.856
How do you do that?

46:17.649 --> 46:19.067
If I just suck it up,

46:21.820 --> 46:23.572
nothing will happen.

46:25.491 --> 46:27.117
If I let my emotions get the better of me

46:27.701 --> 46:29.286
without thinking about the consequences,

46:32.247 --> 46:34.333
Sang-tae and I wouldn't have
this kind of relationship.

46:36.126 --> 46:37.794
Keeping it all inside and enduring it

46:39.963 --> 46:41.548
is the only way

46:43.175 --> 46:44.593
I can protect Sang-tae.

46:48.222 --> 46:49.681
I think that's why we're meant to be.

46:54.937 --> 46:56.563
You're patient,

46:56.939 --> 46:58.190
and I'm volatile.

46:59.900 --> 47:01.443
Like a bomb and its safety pin.

47:02.277 --> 47:04.196
We go hand in hand.

47:05.781 --> 47:07.157
We're meant to be together.

47:10.244 --> 47:12.204
How many guys
do you think you're meant to be with?

47:12.996 --> 47:13.830
What do you mean?

47:14.623 --> 47:16.458
Why don't you go ask your "handsome" fan?

47:16.542 --> 47:17.501
"Handsome"?

47:25.551 --> 47:26.385
You mean, this pen?

47:29.304 --> 47:30.305
What do you think?

47:31.431 --> 47:32.724
Isn't it so handsome?

47:33.934 --> 47:36.311
Just look at this shape. It's perfect.

47:39.064 --> 47:40.357
But you know,

47:46.280 --> 47:48.323
you're much more handsome

47:49.241 --> 47:50.534
than this pen.

47:52.035 --> 47:53.870
Gosh, what are you doing?

47:55.455 --> 47:56.873
So don't be jealous.

48:00.168 --> 48:01.587
What? I'm not jealous.

48:02.087 --> 48:03.505
I'm sleepy.

48:05.173 --> 48:06.592
Go upstairs and sleep.

48:06.675 --> 48:09.094
I don't want to. Mang-tae is here.

48:10.846 --> 48:12.014
Relax, will you?

48:18.270 --> 48:20.731
By the way, did Director O call you?

48:21.481 --> 48:22.899
About resuming your class.

48:23.859 --> 48:25.068
He did.

48:25.652 --> 48:26.486
I see.

48:28.071 --> 48:29.823
They received many requests
from the patients.

48:31.450 --> 48:32.284
I guess

48:33.619 --> 48:34.828
they all liked your class.

50:30.736 --> 50:31.820
My mustache!

50:33.905 --> 50:35.365
Where did my mustache go?

50:36.408 --> 50:37.617
Oh, that.

50:38.285 --> 50:39.286
I shaved it off.

50:42.706 --> 50:43.540
What?

50:44.374 --> 50:45.208
Why?

50:46.334 --> 50:47.210
Well...

50:47.711 --> 50:48.545
Damn you!

50:50.672 --> 50:53.133
How dare you touch my mustache?

50:53.216 --> 50:55.510
You're partially responsible. Let go!

50:57.596 --> 50:58.597
- You little...
- What?

51:02.309 --> 51:03.852
Wait, hold on. No.

51:04.227 --> 51:06.730
No. Please! No!

51:09.608 --> 51:10.817
Ko Mun-yeong...

51:10.901 --> 51:13.195
- You bitch.
- I can't focus because of him.

51:13.987 --> 51:16.323
Seriously, what a pain in the butt!

52:15.715 --> 52:16.800
You had gum stuck on it?

52:16.883 --> 52:20.387
Yes, it was glued on it.

52:21.429 --> 52:22.639
My goodness.

52:23.890 --> 52:26.560
You look so handsome
without your mustache.

52:26.852 --> 52:28.770
Jae-su, I'm glad you shaved it off.

52:31.815 --> 52:34.442
Thank you so much, Jae-su.

52:35.443 --> 52:36.278
My gosh.

52:36.444 --> 52:38.363
Didn't he lash out at me
for shaving it off?

52:45.579 --> 52:46.872
What are you doing, Seung-jae?

52:50.125 --> 52:51.710
Good morning, Ju-ri.

52:52.294 --> 52:54.462
Did I wake you up?

52:54.546 --> 52:55.422
No.

52:55.922 --> 52:57.883
Why are you cleaning out of the blue?

52:57.966 --> 53:01.720
Oh, I figured I should do something
to help out

53:01.803 --> 53:03.722
while staying here with you.

53:04.055 --> 53:06.266
I'll be in charge of cleaning the room.

53:07.392 --> 53:10.604
Just pretend I'm not here.

53:10.687 --> 53:12.397
Don't mind me.

53:19.696 --> 53:20.906
Ju-ri.

53:21.615 --> 53:22.949
Do you notice anything different?

53:23.033 --> 53:25.160
You looked better with a mustache.
Why did you shave?

53:29.539 --> 53:31.291
Here, have some meat.

53:33.460 --> 53:36.630
Sang-tae can be a handful,

53:36.713 --> 53:40.050
but he can draw very well,

53:40.258 --> 53:41.760
so please take good care of him.

53:41.843 --> 53:45.221
Then I'll make sure
there's always meat on the table.

53:45.305 --> 53:48.183
My gosh. Don't you worry, ma'am.

53:49.267 --> 53:51.561
I have to say, this is a feast.

53:51.645 --> 53:53.271
I don't even know what I should eat first.

53:55.357 --> 53:56.232
The soup is too salty.

54:06.409 --> 54:07.327
Eat up.

54:11.039 --> 54:13.375
I must say, you're very impressive.

54:13.458 --> 54:16.878
You're still young,
yet you have your own publishing company.

54:18.546 --> 54:20.382
I run my own pizzeria
despite my young age--

54:20.507 --> 54:21.716
Ms. Kang.

54:22.133 --> 54:26.429
I know I'm only paying
200,000 won a month to stay here,

54:27.138 --> 54:29.766
but I'll get back on my feet again soon

54:29.849 --> 54:33.436
and make sure I repay your kindness
a thousandfold.

54:33.520 --> 54:37.023
Then finish your food quickly.
Let's put it down in writing.

54:39.442 --> 54:40.276
My gosh.

54:49.119 --> 54:52.539
What is it now? Why are you in a bad mood?

54:52.622 --> 54:55.083
Why did you ask Mr. Lee
what his parents do?

54:55.166 --> 54:57.043
He'll stay with us for a while.

54:57.127 --> 54:59.129
I can't even ask him about his family?

54:59.462 --> 55:02.132
It bothers me
that you seem so intrigued by him.

55:02.716 --> 55:04.801
Because he's interested in you.

55:05.427 --> 55:06.261
How did you know?

55:06.344 --> 55:08.221
When you get to my age, you'll understand.

55:08.304 --> 55:10.557
There are some things
that you just know when you're older.

55:11.975 --> 55:13.268
If you know that,

55:13.935 --> 55:15.895
don't lead him on.

55:16.479 --> 55:19.065
He's hardworking and cheerful.

55:19.357 --> 55:21.026
He seems like a responsible guy.
So why not?

55:21.109 --> 55:24.362
Mom, you know why I'm being like this.

55:25.363 --> 55:27.282
Yes, I know. That's why I'm saying this.

55:28.074 --> 55:31.369
That guy won't even reciprocate
my dear daughter's feelings.

55:31.661 --> 55:32.871
I, too, hate him for that.

55:34.706 --> 55:35.957
I hate him,

55:37.208 --> 55:38.334
but I also feel bad for him.

55:40.378 --> 55:42.964
However, you matter a lot more to me.

55:44.257 --> 55:47.343
You told me to keep on chasing after him
even if he rejects me.

55:47.844 --> 55:49.679
I'm worried that
you're going to follow him

55:49.763 --> 55:52.432
to the edge of a cliff
if I let you continue to chase after him.

56:03.193 --> 56:04.235
Hello.

56:04.319 --> 56:05.987
Oh, that's your live-in cook.

56:06.571 --> 56:08.615
The three of you came together?

56:08.698 --> 56:11.868
Yes, I'm here to work on the mural.
Gang-tae has his day shift,

56:11.951 --> 56:13.703
and Ms. Ko has her class.

56:14.329 --> 56:15.830
- Is that right?
- Yes.

56:16.498 --> 56:17.582
You got a haircut.

56:18.166 --> 56:19.167
It looks nice.

56:20.752 --> 56:22.462
He gave me a haircut.

56:26.508 --> 56:27.884
You cut her hair?

56:27.967 --> 56:30.887
Why did you do that?
She looks prettier with long hair.

56:32.972 --> 56:34.808
Come over when you have some time.

56:34.891 --> 56:36.392
I'll make some food for you.

56:38.228 --> 56:40.021
I don't think
your daughter likes the idea.

56:42.357 --> 56:43.733
She takes after me,

56:43.817 --> 56:45.026
so she can't hide her feelings.

56:47.445 --> 56:49.614
Don't worry.
Just come over and have some food.

56:49.948 --> 56:52.158
You two can fight again
if you have any energy left.

56:52.242 --> 56:54.702
Even better if you girls can make up
after the fight.

56:56.663 --> 56:57.914
We have to go.

57:08.049 --> 57:09.300
Do you like that two-faced girl?

57:10.343 --> 57:11.261
What?

57:11.761 --> 57:14.681
- Why did you cut Ms. Ko's hair? Why?
- Sang-tae, that's...

57:14.764 --> 57:16.432
Or do you have a crush
on your live-in cook?

57:17.267 --> 57:18.393
Stop talking nonsense.

57:18.476 --> 57:20.019
Then why did you unlink my arm?

57:20.103 --> 57:21.604
Why should I link arms with you?

57:21.688 --> 57:23.064
Because we go hand in hand.

57:23.690 --> 57:24.858
Let go.

57:25.024 --> 57:27.318
The bomb needs its safety pin.

57:27.402 --> 57:31.156
Let me... Let me join.
I want to link arms too.

57:33.158 --> 57:34.826
- Okay?
- Look ahead of you,

57:34.909 --> 57:36.369
or you'll trip and fall. Look ahead.

57:36.453 --> 57:37.537
- Okay?
- Look ahead of you.

57:37.620 --> 57:39.581
Look ahead of you,
or you'll trip and fall.

57:48.214 --> 57:50.717
Gosh, I thought you'd be mad at me
and refuse to teach.

57:50.800 --> 57:52.469
I was so worried yesterday.

57:53.678 --> 57:57.140
Well, I heard the patients
miss my class like crazy.

57:57.807 --> 57:58.766
Did Mr. Moon say that?

58:00.351 --> 58:03.480
I guess he was too embarrassed
to tell you that he threatened me.

58:05.190 --> 58:06.566
He threatened you?

58:07.066 --> 58:09.444
He said I'd better resume
the fairy tale class,

58:09.527 --> 58:12.113
or he wouldn't do anything
I tell him to do.

58:12.197 --> 58:14.908
He glared at me and gave me an ultimatum.

58:16.034 --> 58:17.202
Why did he do that?

58:17.494 --> 58:21.164
I guess he wants to see you
even when he's working.

58:25.084 --> 58:26.878
There's something I want to ask you.

58:29.130 --> 58:30.089
Do you,

58:31.341 --> 58:35.303
by any chance,
know our patient, Ms. Park Ok-ran?

58:38.848 --> 58:40.391
Park Ok-ran?

58:41.017 --> 58:42.560
Oh, her.

58:43.937 --> 58:45.522
- You know her?
- Yes.

58:49.275 --> 58:50.777
She's in my class.

58:53.112 --> 58:53.947
What about her?

58:54.739 --> 58:56.824
I was just wondering
if she was enjoying the class.

59:00.370 --> 59:03.498
If you feel dizzy
or have trouble falling asleep

59:04.040 --> 59:05.333
after taking the medication,

59:05.542 --> 59:07.043
- Open your mouth, please.
- let us know.

59:10.505 --> 59:11.548
Roll your tongue like this.

59:26.145 --> 59:28.439
Thanks so much, brother.

59:28.773 --> 59:30.525
For not telling Ms. Park.

59:32.443 --> 59:33.903
I'm still undecided.

59:35.321 --> 59:37.365
You see, A-reum and I

59:37.448 --> 59:40.034
promised each other
that we'd wait until we get discharged.

59:40.326 --> 59:42.412
We have to follow the rules, you know.

59:43.663 --> 59:45.498
We'll focus on getting better so that

59:45.582 --> 59:47.292
we can be discharged soon
and love each other

59:47.375 --> 59:49.085
as much as we want
after we leave this place.

59:51.170 --> 59:52.213
I'm glad to hear that.

59:53.214 --> 59:55.842
Your determination is what matters.

59:56.718 --> 59:59.804
But to be honest, it's hard.

01:00:00.555 --> 01:00:03.474
Unlike you, I'm not that patient.

01:00:04.684 --> 01:00:06.019
It'd be better if I never saw her.

01:00:06.644 --> 01:00:08.813
I see her every day,
and it's really driving me crazy.

01:00:09.355 --> 01:00:10.898
I tell myself to just never look at her.

01:00:11.232 --> 01:00:13.943
But I keep thinking about her
even when I close my eyes.

01:00:18.448 --> 01:00:19.782
Then when I see her,

01:00:20.116 --> 01:00:21.451
I want to touch her.

01:00:28.291 --> 01:00:30.001
Whenever I see her smile with another guy,

01:00:30.084 --> 01:00:31.419
I get so pissed off.

01:00:38.426 --> 01:00:39.844
Beauty and the Beast was written by

01:00:39.927 --> 01:00:42.972
Jeanne-Marie Le Prince de Beaumont,
a French author in the Middle Ages.

01:00:44.182 --> 01:00:47.268
It was only when the story
was adapted into an animated film

01:00:47.352 --> 01:00:49.771
- that the image of...
- My head keeps saying I shouldn't,

01:00:50.063 --> 01:00:51.356
but I can't stop looking at her.

01:00:51.439 --> 01:00:53.608
- The story is said to teach us
- And my heart

01:00:53.983 --> 01:00:55.318
- to never judge anyone
- can only follow my eyes.

01:00:55.401 --> 01:00:56.736
by their looks alone.

01:00:56.819 --> 01:00:58.321
It's really driving me crazy.

01:01:10.541 --> 01:01:13.795
But that's just what adults
want to tell children

01:01:14.003 --> 01:01:16.089
to discipline them.

01:01:28.017 --> 01:01:31.062
Beauty and the Beast is a story
about Stockholm Syndrome.

01:01:32.605 --> 01:01:35.316
The Beast lives alone
in the castle because of a curse.

01:01:35.400 --> 01:01:37.902
He holds a lady named Belle hostage
in the castle

01:01:37.985 --> 01:01:40.488
and grooms this victim of his.
That's what the story is about.

01:01:41.072 --> 01:01:43.324
Isn't it about a kindhearted lady

01:01:43.408 --> 01:01:45.201
being locked in a castle
instead of her father

01:01:45.284 --> 01:01:47.078
and helping the Beast
remove the curse on him

01:01:47.161 --> 01:01:49.664
because she falls in love with him?

01:01:52.625 --> 01:01:55.670
The Beast is usually selfish
and harsh on Belle.

01:01:56.379 --> 01:01:58.506
So doing something nice
once in a blue moon

01:01:58.589 --> 01:02:00.591
and gazing at her
with a faint smile on his face

01:02:01.384 --> 01:02:04.512
was enough to move the naive lady, Belle.

01:02:07.265 --> 01:02:08.099
"Yes.

01:02:09.183 --> 01:02:12.979
The Beast is lonely.
I should embrace him with my love.

01:02:13.896 --> 01:02:16.607
Only I can change him."

01:02:18.234 --> 01:02:20.027
But Belle was being delusional.

01:02:20.111 --> 01:02:21.195
Correct.

01:02:22.905 --> 01:02:24.323
No!

01:02:24.407 --> 01:02:26.784
- A-reum!
- Beauty and the Beast

01:02:27.034 --> 01:02:29.579
isn't some crude story
about the Beast grooming his victim.

01:02:30.830 --> 01:02:32.457
- Then what is it?
- The Beast

01:02:32.540 --> 01:02:34.792
turns into a prince

01:02:36.294 --> 01:02:38.629
because of the power of Belle's true love.

01:02:40.339 --> 01:02:41.507
Belle's love

01:02:41.966 --> 01:02:44.510
calmed the Beast's violent nature.

01:02:46.012 --> 01:02:46.929
That love

01:02:48.347 --> 01:02:50.433
embraced his wounded soul.

01:02:52.185 --> 01:02:54.562
The greatest thing anyone can do
as a human being...

01:02:55.855 --> 01:02:58.316
It's...

01:02:59.442 --> 01:03:00.777
pure love.

01:03:00.860 --> 01:03:02.528
Hey, I'm about to puke.

01:03:03.154 --> 01:03:05.907
The drugs must be wearing off.
Did you take your medication?

01:03:10.536 --> 01:03:11.621
That love

01:03:12.371 --> 01:03:14.749
embraced his wounded soul.

01:03:22.298 --> 01:03:23.299
Love?

01:03:25.968 --> 01:03:31.599
It is a flower

01:03:31.682 --> 01:03:36.312
It is a flower

01:03:36.395 --> 01:03:41.359
It is a flower

01:03:42.276 --> 01:03:43.444
Oh, my.

01:03:43.945 --> 01:03:45.696
This really is a work of art.

01:03:45.780 --> 01:03:47.073
Hello!

01:03:47.156 --> 01:03:48.241
Hello.

01:03:49.200 --> 01:03:52.870
This mural totally
brightened up the space.

01:03:53.371 --> 01:03:55.957
When did you learn to paint so well?

01:03:56.040 --> 01:03:59.502
I was born with the talent.
It's a natural-born talent.

01:03:59.585 --> 01:04:01.087
I never had to learn it.

01:04:01.170 --> 01:04:02.797
- Oh, you were born with it.
- Yes.

01:04:03.589 --> 01:04:06.008
My gosh, I really envy those
who can draw or paint well.

01:04:06.092 --> 01:04:07.343
Yes.

01:04:07.635 --> 01:04:11.848
May I paint a little flower right here?

01:04:11.931 --> 01:04:13.349
No! Don't touch it.

01:04:13.432 --> 01:04:16.477
Don't touch my brush.
Don't touch my mural.

01:04:16.561 --> 01:04:18.604
Oh, okay. I won't touch it.

01:04:18.688 --> 01:04:21.065
- Okay.
- I won't touch any of this.

01:04:21.148 --> 01:04:22.733
It is a flower

01:04:22.817 --> 01:04:25.069
Even if it blooms in the mountains

01:04:25.152 --> 01:04:26.821
- It is a flower
- What are you listening to?

01:04:26.904 --> 01:04:28.990
It is a flower

01:04:29.073 --> 01:04:31.158
- "It's all Flowers"?
- Yes.

01:04:31.242 --> 01:04:33.494
I love that song.

01:04:33.578 --> 01:04:34.954
Even if it blooms in the mountains

01:04:35.037 --> 01:04:36.831
- It is a flower
- It is a flower

01:04:36.914 --> 01:04:38.124
Even if it blooms in the field

01:04:38.207 --> 01:04:39.542
- It is a flower
- It is a flower

01:04:39.625 --> 01:04:40.751
- Even if it blooms in the field
- Even if it blooms in the field

01:04:40.835 --> 01:04:42.003
- It is a flower
- It is a flower

01:04:42.086 --> 01:04:43.671
- That song, right?
- Yes.

01:04:45.631 --> 01:04:47.341
When you're done with this,

01:04:47.425 --> 01:04:49.385
would you like to come with me
to see some flowers?

01:04:49.468 --> 01:04:50.303
Sure.

01:04:50.761 --> 01:04:52.889
My gosh, this is incredible.

01:04:52.972 --> 01:04:53.931
You're amazing.

01:04:54.015 --> 01:04:54.849
Thank you.

01:05:15.536 --> 01:05:17.997
Will Ms. Lee A-reum be okay?

01:05:20.750 --> 01:05:22.001
She agreed to meet him.

01:05:22.084 --> 01:05:24.754
Mr. O is in there with her,
so let's see how it goes.

01:05:24.837 --> 01:05:27.048
I heard he used to hit her.

01:05:27.882 --> 01:05:30.092
Why visit her when they're divorced?
He has no shame.

01:05:30.843 --> 01:05:33.387
Anyway, Ms. Lee is too nice.

01:05:33.721 --> 01:05:35.222
Why would she even see him?

01:05:36.182 --> 01:05:37.975
They went to middle school together.

01:05:39.143 --> 01:05:41.228
They've known each other
for more than half their lives

01:05:41.312 --> 01:05:43.814
if we include the three years
they were married to one another.

01:05:44.649 --> 01:05:46.317
I'm sure it's hard to just sever all ties.

01:05:47.568 --> 01:05:50.154
This is why grooming is scary.

01:05:51.405 --> 01:05:53.324
Ms. Ko was so right.

01:06:06.837 --> 01:06:08.506
A-reum! Wait, A-reum!

01:06:08.589 --> 01:06:09.590
A-reum.

01:06:09.674 --> 01:06:10.675
Let go.

01:06:11.342 --> 01:06:12.760
Don't visit me ever again.

01:06:13.052 --> 01:06:14.387
I'm sorry for everything.

01:06:14.470 --> 01:06:15.304
Let's start over.

01:06:15.388 --> 01:06:16.931
I promise I'll be good to you.

01:06:17.640 --> 01:06:18.975
I won't be fooled again.

01:06:19.058 --> 01:06:20.893
Things are already over between us,

01:06:20.977 --> 01:06:22.937
and I'll start afresh
when I leave this place.

01:06:23.104 --> 01:06:24.105
A-reum.

01:06:24.522 --> 01:06:26.816
Think about the times
when we were happy together.

01:06:26.899 --> 01:06:28.985
If I... If I hit you again,

01:06:29.068 --> 01:06:31.904
I'll cut my hand off. I really mean it.

01:06:31.988 --> 01:06:33.531
There's someone I like.

01:06:34.991 --> 01:06:35.866
What?

01:06:40.454 --> 01:06:43.958
What the hell are you talking about?

01:06:44.041 --> 01:06:46.293
I'm going to live with him
when I get discharged,

01:06:46.836 --> 01:06:48.462
so just move on and live your life.

01:06:48.587 --> 01:06:50.172
You're already seeing some bastard?

01:06:50.256 --> 01:06:52.341
- You're hurting me. Let go!
- You piece of...

01:07:00.182 --> 01:07:01.017
Oh, my.

01:07:01.809 --> 01:07:03.269
I thought you were the trash can.

01:07:03.352 --> 01:07:04.270
Ms. Ko!

01:07:07.440 --> 01:07:09.734
I sure am at a psychiatric hospital.

01:07:10.151 --> 01:07:11.318
It's full of crazy bitches.

01:07:11.402 --> 01:07:13.112
Why don't you check yourself in too?

01:07:14.155 --> 01:07:14.989
You crazy bastard.

01:07:17.199 --> 01:07:18.451
Goodness...

01:07:19.326 --> 01:07:21.120
Hey, get up.

01:07:21.203 --> 01:07:23.748
I said, get up.
You're not going to get up?

01:07:34.675 --> 01:07:35.509
Mr. Moon!

01:07:36.218 --> 01:07:38.012
- Just a moment.
- No, no...

01:07:43.142 --> 01:07:45.019
Gang-tae! Stop.

01:07:45.102 --> 01:07:46.395
You know you shouldn't do this.

01:07:46.479 --> 01:07:47.605
Stop.

01:07:49.273 --> 01:07:50.357
What are you doing?

01:07:50.441 --> 01:07:52.359
Enough. Stop.

01:07:52.443 --> 01:07:54.070
No! Don't, Mr. Moon.

01:07:56.113 --> 01:07:56.989
Please don't.

01:07:58.741 --> 01:07:59.784
Please...

01:08:02.703 --> 01:08:05.331
Don't hit him. No, no.
You shouldn't hit him.

01:08:05.790 --> 01:08:06.707
You shouldn't hit him.

01:08:57.049 --> 01:08:57.925
Are you okay?

01:09:00.553 --> 01:09:01.470
No.

01:09:04.390 --> 01:09:05.224
It hurts.

01:09:47.474 --> 01:09:48.517
What are you going to do?

01:09:49.018 --> 01:09:51.437
Well, technically it is self-defense...

01:09:51.520 --> 01:09:52.646
No, it isn't...

01:09:53.606 --> 01:09:56.609
- It's excessive use of force--
- Whatever the reason,

01:09:56.692 --> 01:10:00.237
a caregiver punched a visitor,
so he should be punished.

01:10:00.321 --> 01:10:03.282
If A-reum hadn't stepped in,
it could have been much worse.

01:10:03.365 --> 01:10:05.075
And it's not just about Mr. Moon

01:10:05.159 --> 01:10:07.036
- but the honor of the hospital--
- You heard her, right?

01:10:07.703 --> 01:10:09.330
Try to justify yourself.

01:10:10.789 --> 01:10:12.166
I'm sorry. My brother...

01:10:12.791 --> 01:10:15.878
I'm sorry. My brother... I'm sorry, I...

01:10:15.961 --> 01:10:19.089
I'm the older brother
so I will give a good talking to him.

01:10:19.173 --> 01:10:20.966
You should've tolerated it.
Why did you do that?

01:10:21.050 --> 01:10:23.844
Did you count to three
in your head or not?

01:10:23.928 --> 01:10:26.305
You should've counted to three.

01:10:27.264 --> 01:10:29.183
I will accept any punishment.
Whatever it may be.

01:10:29.683 --> 01:10:31.560
Well, firing you may be going overboard.

01:10:31.769 --> 01:10:33.520
But reprimanding you won't be enough.

01:10:36.023 --> 01:10:37.608
I guess, I'll have to suspend you.

01:10:38.400 --> 01:10:40.903
And you won't be paid
while you are suspended.

01:10:42.404 --> 01:10:43.239
Yes.

01:10:43.822 --> 01:10:44.657
Go pack your things.

01:10:49.036 --> 01:10:50.621
Hey, are you on drugs? Or are you drunk?

01:10:50.704 --> 01:10:52.831
Why did you punch him?
He's definitely going to sue you.

01:10:53.999 --> 01:10:54.917
Why did you do that?

01:10:56.043 --> 01:10:58.087
You are good at keeping it
all inside and enduring it.

01:11:03.759 --> 01:11:04.593
Bye.

01:11:11.809 --> 01:11:12.726
Gang-tae.

01:11:17.022 --> 01:11:19.358
Are you really leaving? Just like that?

01:11:21.193 --> 01:11:22.611
Can't you say you're sorry

01:11:22.695 --> 01:11:24.321
and that it was a mistake?

01:11:24.405 --> 01:11:25.406
It wasn't...

01:11:26.699 --> 01:11:27.533
a mistake.

01:11:45.843 --> 01:11:46.677
Mr. Moon.

01:11:47.803 --> 01:11:49.054
You were so cool.

01:11:49.138 --> 01:11:50.222
You rock!

01:11:51.390 --> 01:11:53.559
Oh no. It's all because of that jerk.

01:11:53.851 --> 01:11:56.395
Gang-tae, come back soon, okay?
We'll be waiting for you.

01:12:02.609 --> 01:12:03.444
Mr. Moon...

01:12:09.199 --> 01:12:10.284
Why is he smiling?

01:12:10.951 --> 01:12:11.952
No, he isn't.

01:12:12.661 --> 01:12:14.496
He got suspended.
He's probably close to crying.

01:12:15.164 --> 01:12:18.375
No. I saw him smiling just now.

01:12:36.310 --> 01:12:38.312
Okay, fine.
When it looks like you want to run away,

01:12:38.395 --> 01:12:40.481
I'll run away with you
right there and then.

01:12:41.398 --> 01:12:43.609
OK PSYCHIATRIC HOSPITAL

01:13:45.796 --> 01:13:47.005
I...

01:13:47.423 --> 01:13:48.424
got suspended.

01:13:51.135 --> 01:13:53.178
They're not going to
pay me during my suspension

01:13:53.971 --> 01:13:55.722
and I'm probably going to get sued.

01:13:58.058 --> 01:13:59.977
Everything is so messed up.

01:14:02.187 --> 01:14:03.439
You said before

01:14:05.107 --> 01:14:06.567
you'll run away with me

01:14:07.734 --> 01:14:08.694
whenever I want.

01:14:14.700 --> 01:14:15.617
I want to

01:14:16.493 --> 01:14:17.744
go on a trip with you.

01:14:22.583 --> 01:14:23.459
Right now.

01:14:29.673 --> 01:14:30.549
Let's go.

01:15:14.343 --> 01:15:17.429
SPECIAL THANKS TO CHOI DANIEL
FOR MAKING A GUEST APPEARANCE

01:16:00.764 --> 01:16:03.058
I feel like you are taming me.

01:16:03.141 --> 01:16:05.227
Ko Mun-yeong!

01:16:06.228 --> 01:16:07.604
I must be out of my mind.

01:16:07.688 --> 01:16:10.065
Is this the deviation
you've been dreaming of?

01:16:10.148 --> 01:16:11.650
I can't come here with Sang-tae.

01:16:12.234 --> 01:16:14.278
I keep doing things I wouldn't normally do

01:16:14.361 --> 01:16:15.779
because of you.

01:16:16.363 --> 01:16:17.447
Why didn't you pick up?

01:16:19.157 --> 01:16:21.034
What if she isn't dead?

01:16:21.952 --> 01:16:23.412
What if she just disappeared?

01:16:23.704 --> 01:16:25.831
Who do you like more?
Me or Ms. Ko Mun-yeong?

01:16:26.415 --> 01:16:28.041
I don't want you to spend your entire life

01:16:28.542 --> 01:16:29.626
taking care of your brother.
